<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interstate Bakeries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interstate Bakeries.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Natwest Securities analyst David Nelson said he raised his rating on Interstate Bakeries Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- &quot;IBC posted much higher than expected earnings (on Thursday), confirming our expectations that the company's turnaround is in place and earnings leverage resulting from company-specific improvements and industry consolidation will be greater than anticipated,&quot; Nelson said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 37.</p>
</text>
